In Re: CRA 702 of 2018

For convenience the 'Third Schedule is set out as follows:
"[THE THIRD SCHEDULE [See clause (b) of Explanation to section 15(1)]
SECURITY FEATURES TO DEFINE HIGH QUALITY COUNTERFEIT INDIAN CURRENCY NOTES Watermark(s), Security thread and any one of the following features:
(a) Latent image;
(b) See through registration;
(c) Print quality sharpness;
(d) Raised effect'
(e) Fluorescent characteristics;
(f) Substrate quality;
(g) Paper taggant;
(h) Colour shift effect in OVI;
(i) Colour shift effect in security thread.]"
